    "description": "Official licensing app of the Michigan Department of Natural Resources.\r\n \r\nMichigan DNR Hunt Fish is an official application of the Michigan Department of Natural Resources. Michigan DNR Hunt Fish is a way for Michigan\u2019s hunters, anglers, and outdoor enthusiasts to purchase and view licenses, review licensing information, review regulation information, view DNR communications and complete harvest reports through your mobile device.\r\n \r\nFeatures include:\r\n \r\nEasy Account Access - create an account or sync with your current account(s) in the Michigan DNR eLicense System.\r\n \r\n \r\nConvenient Purchasing - purchase hunting and fishing licenses, permits, duck stamps, endorsements, and DNR trail permits. \r\n \r\n \r\nViewing Purchase History - view current and past licenses and permits.\r\n \r\n \r\nReporting a Harvest - report your harvest right from your mobile device.\r\n \r\n \r\nMaps - find information on and get directions to Michigan state forest campgrounds, state parks, boat ramps, and shooting ranges.\r\n \r\n \r\nResources - download and view the latest hunting and fishing digests, weekly fishing report, information on seasons and dates, and other popular resources for outdoor enthusiasts.\r\n \r\n \r\nWeather - before heading out on the water or in the field, view the current weather conditions and sunrise/sunset times.\r\n \r\n \r\nThe application requires internet access through Wi-Fi or a cellular wireless connection to access features like purchasing and harvest reporting, viewing preference point and chance totals, drawing results, educational safety certificates, and enrolling in Auto-Renewal.",
